@startuml state-courier-availability
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fafafa
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Courier Availability — State Machine

[*] --> UNAVAILABLE : courier logs in (default)

UNAVAILABLE --> AVAILABLE : courier sets available (COU-01)

AVAILABLE --> UNAVAILABLE : courier sets unavailable (COU-01)
AVAILABLE --> UNAVAILABLE : courier logs out (implicit)

AVAILABLE : enters candidate pool for dispatch
UNAVAILABLE : excluded from dispatch

note right of AVAILABLE
  Being AVAILABLE does not prevent
  receiving offers while already on a delivery.
  The load (activeDeliveries count in
  CourierSnapshot) is the secondary filter.
  Maximum simultaneous deliveries per courier:
  set in ADR 0008.
end note
@enduml
